WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.768
-Now I thought I'd share some of
my favorite "My Family is Weird"

00:00:01.768 --> 00:00:02.902 align:start size:94% position:6%
stories from you guys.
Here we go.

00:00:02.902 --> 00:00:05.372 align:start size:94% position:6%
This first one's
from @RockyHoare.

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:08.908 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Wait.
"Horror" or "whore"?

00:00:08.908 --> 00:00:11.444 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause I was with
a rocky whore in the Navy.

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:14.848 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I hate to say --

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:17.650 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hate to say it,
but it's "RockyHoare."

00:00:17.650 --> 00:00:19.185 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:20.020 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
H-O-A-R-E.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, like hoarfrost.
Like a --

00:00:22.022 --> 00:00:23.556 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Yes. Sure.

00:00:23.556 --> 00:00:24.424 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Why not?

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:26.893 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-She says...

00:00:29.596 --> 00:00:31.464 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It's like, "Oh!

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:32.465 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
I can't do that.

00:00:32.465 --> 00:00:34.200 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Ugh! Freezing!

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:34.934 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-"I got brain freeze!"

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:37.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"These frozen margaritas
are so cold!"

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:37.971 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.971 --> 00:00:39.305 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then don't order
a frozen margarita.

00:00:39.305 --> 00:00:41.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Don't do it.
[ Laughs ]

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:45.445 line:92%
-This one's from @poeTAYYtoe.

00:00:45.445 --> 00:00:47.447 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Oh, nice.

00:00:47.447 --> 00:00:49.649 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-She says...

00:00:54.821 --> 00:00:57.323 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:57.323 --> 00:00:58.825 size:81% position:41% line:92%
"I love those morons."

00:00:58.825 --> 00:00:59.259 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah.

00:00:59.259 --> 00:01:01.795 align:start size:94% position:6%
-"I love the morons.
They're great."

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:03.563 line:92%
-More cheese and crackers?

00:01:03.563 --> 00:01:05.899 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.434 line:92%
-"Squeeze cheese on a Ritz?"

00:01:07.434 --> 00:01:08.768 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Uh, yeah, thanks.

00:01:08.768 --> 00:01:13.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from @hullojess,
but H-U-L-L.

00:01:13.773 --> 00:01:15.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Hullo."
-"Hullo, Jess."

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:17.377 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hullo.

00:01:17.377 --> 00:01:19.879 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hullo.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:21.247 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hullo, Jess.

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:23.116 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
She says...

00:01:27.087 --> 00:01:30.857 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:32.292 line:92%
Well, you still have your eyes.

00:01:32.292 --> 00:01:34.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
Turned them into horns.

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:35.962 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-So maybe he was right.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:37.097 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Maybe he had a point.

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.465 line:92%
Maybe he had a bunch of points.

00:01:38.465 --> 00:01:39.532 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Ha ha ha ha!

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:42.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Save it, save it.
Save your energy, guys.

00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:47.941 align:start size:94% position:6%
This one's from
@CptnSwan4TheWin.

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:48.475 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Captain --

00:01:48.475 --> 00:01:50.376 align:start size:94% position:6%
