of characters right there.

00:01:50.376 --> 00:01:52.412 align:start size:94% position:6%
You can't tweet anything.
-No more names.

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:54.180 line:92%
-Captain Swan for the win.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.182 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
She says...

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:01.754 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There's a photo.

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:03.623
Lookit -- there's the photo
right there she sent in.

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:08.228 line:92%
